    """No `name.match` means no lexicon entry, so sentiment scores it zero.

    Silently: match-models builds its table from the models that HAVE one, and
    a missing alias reads downstream as a model nobody discussed. 26 of 65
    entries have none and most are deliberate -- an image model has no forum
    prose to match -- so this prints for a human rather than failing.
    """
